<title>USA: Putnam Investment III Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Putnam Investment III Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three mos		Three mos</p>
<p>					    ended		    ended</p>
<p>				  Jan. 31, 1997	   Jan. 31, 1996</p>
<p>Total investment income</p>
<p> Total			     $ 1,043,528	    $   970,123</p>
<p> Per common share			  .26			.24</p>
<p>Net investment income</p>
<p> Total				   795,941		  715,155</p>
<p> Per common share			  .20			.18</p>
<p>Net realized and unrealized </p>
<p>gain on investments</p>
<p> Total				   132,278		1,406,862</p>
<p> Per common share			  .03			.35</p>
<p>Net increase in net assets</p>
<p>resulting from operations</p>
<p> Total				   928,219		2,122,017</p>
<p> Per common share			  .23			.53</p>
<p>Net assets available at the</p>
<p>end of the period</p>
<p> Total				52,279,196	     54,292,496</p>
<p> Per common share			13.05		    13.55</p>
<p>NOTE:  Putnam Investment Grade Municipal Trust III said the first quarter period ended January 31.</p>
</text>
